{"id":"n32502-2-8","stage":4,"title":"기막히다 · 不得了","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32502-2-8-1","ko":"이 식당의 인기 메뉴는 뭐예요?","zh":"这家餐厅最受欢迎的特色菜是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식당의","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인기","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"메뉴는","meaning":"菜品","explanation":"메뉴：菜品；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"메뉴","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57299","senseId":"2","lemma":"메뉴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"97bd6aed2c720b21","term":"인기","zh":"人气","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3","entryId":"70758","definition":"许多人对某个对象的浓厚兴趣或喜爱之心。","pronunciation":["인끼"]},{"id":"13b36d6d0ccc7f49","term":"메뉴","zh":"菜品","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3","entryId":"57299","definition":"料理的种类。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/cf0caf9ad33039977736.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32502-2-8-2","ko":"여기는 비빔밥이 아주 기막히게 맛있어요.","zh":"这里的拌饭味道好极了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기는","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비빔밥이","meaning":"拌饭","explanation":"비빔밥：拌饭；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비빔밥","audio":"/audio/574c26d169130a0860b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71066","senseId":"1","lemma":"비빔밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기막히게","meaning":"不得了，了不得，绝妙","explanation":"기막히다：不得了，了不得，绝妙；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"기막히다","audio":"/audio/2e88c7c4f95ae698736d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32502","senseId":"2","lemma":"기막히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있어요.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"574c26d169130a08","term":"비빔밥","zh":"拌饭","audio":"/audio/574c26d169130a0860b8.mp3","entryId":"71066","definition":"在肉丝、蘑菇、鸡蛋、拌菜等材料中加入各种调料后拌着吃的饭。","pronunciation":["비빔빱"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"2e88c7c4f95ae698","term":"기막히다","zh":"不得了，了不得，绝妙","audio":"/audio/2e88c7c4f95ae698736d.mp3","entryId":"32502","definition":"程度或状态好得无法用言语表示。","pronunciation":["기마키다"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/32d6e7d29ba0b3d61704.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32502","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":122,"sequenceScore":1.9067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这家餐厅最受欢迎的特色菜是什么？","这里的拌饭味道好极了。","这家医院的院长在哪儿？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这家餐厅最受欢迎的特色菜是什么？","这里的拌饭味道好极了。","这家医院的院长在哪儿？"],"answer":1}]}
